        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Printfarm Simulator, the unique game that lets you dive into the world of 3D printing!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamed of running your own 3D printing empire? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Printfarm Simulator, you start small with just a printer and an empty room and work your way up to building a full-scale print farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/90a895f7882f510f9cfabdd023b6f51b.poster.avif?t=1788518031\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/90a895f7882f510f9cfabdd023b6f51b.webm?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/90a895f7882f510f9cfabdd023b6f51b.mp4?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Set up your space, start printing, and bring your ideas to life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy your first printer, stock up on filament, and pick from a growing library of 3D models. Watch as your prints come to life layer by layer. Arrange your machines however you like and create a space that feels like your own.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/bc44c4f3070920657bbe6c2f086efd6b.poster.avif?t=1788518031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/bc44c4f3070920657bbe6c2f086efd6b.webm?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/bc44c4f3070920657bbe6c2f086efd6b.mp4?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell your creations or keep them to decorate your room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in control. Sell your printed models to earn money and upgrade your setup, or use them to personalize your space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new printers, better materials, and bigger rooms as your print farm grows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/1027ebb57658908e87dd4589929fe9c3.poster.avif?t=1788518031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/1027ebb57658908e87dd4589929fe9c3.webm?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/1027ebb57658908e87dd4589929fe9c3.mp4?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features you'll enjoy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic 3D printing with different machines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full in-game economy where you print, sell, and reinvest</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of printable objects from useful tools to creative decorations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customizable workspace where your prints become part of the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're into tech, design, or just love the satisfying process of 3D printing, Printfarm Simulator lets you explore, create, and build without limits.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Printfarm Simulator, the unique game that lets you dive into the world of 3D printing!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamed of running your own 3D printing empire? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Printfarm Simulator, you start small with just a printer and an empty room and work your way up to building a full-scale print farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/90a895f7882f510f9cfabdd023b6f51b.poster.avif?t=1788518031\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/90a895f7882f510f9cfabdd023b6f51b.webm?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/90a895f7882f510f9cfabdd023b6f51b.mp4?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Set up your space, start printing, and bring your ideas to life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy your first printer, stock up on filament, and pick from a growing library of 3D models. Watch as your prints come to life layer by layer. Arrange your machines however you like and create a space that feels like your own.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/bc44c4f3070920657bbe6c2f086efd6b.poster.avif?t=1788518031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/bc44c4f3070920657bbe6c2f086efd6b.webm?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/bc44c4f3070920657bbe6c2f086efd6b.mp4?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell your creations or keep them to decorate your room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in control. Sell your printed models to earn money and upgrade your setup, or use them to personalize your space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new printers, better materials, and bigger rooms as your print farm grows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/1027ebb57658908e87dd4589929fe9c3.poster.avif?t=1788518031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/1027ebb57658908e87dd4589929fe9c3.webm?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809950/extras/1027ebb57658908e87dd4589929fe9c3.mp4?t=1788518031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features you'll enjoy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic 3D printing with different machines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full in-game economy where you print, sell, and reinvest</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of printable objects from useful tools to creative decorations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customizable workspace where your prints become part of the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're into tech, design, or just love the satisfying process of 3D printing, Printfarm Simulator lets you explore, create, and build without limits.</p>",
